<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Item
8.01 Other Events</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Reference
is made to the Current Report of the Company under Form 8-K filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on February 26, 2025 wherein
the Company reported that it had obtained stockholder approval to effect a reverse split of its outstanding shares at a ratio of between
1 for 10 and 1 for 30. The Company&#8217;s Board of directors has determined that the ratio will be 1 for 30 to be effective as soon
as possible consistent with the rules of the Nasdaq Stock Market. The Company has received notices from the holders of the Company&#8217;s
Series B Warrants for shares of its Common Stock the number of which currently exceeds the Company&#8217;s authorized shares. Upon the
effective date of the reverse split the Company will be able to complete the issuance of all shares remaining to be issued under the
Series B Warrants.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

